WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.300
<i>A kingdom concealed in darkness, Deltora.</i>

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.650
<i>A royal heirloom, the Belt of Deltora.</i>

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.000
<i>Long ago, in this belt fashioned by the first king,</i>

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.750
<i>Seven gems were placed.</i>

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.600
<i>The gems possessed magical powers,</i>

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.350
<i>And were protected while the king's direct descendants wore the belt.</i>

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.150
<i>But, those gems were hidden in seven mystical lands.</i>

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Since then, the kingdom of Deltora has been shrouded in darkness.</i>

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:42.700
<i>However,</i>

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.200
<i>The light of hope can be seen on the horizon.</i>

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:51.000
<i>Standing against the Shadow Lord, there is a boy who is on a quest to search for the seven gems.</i>

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.000
<i>With light and hope at their side,</i>

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.400
<i>They are off on their adventure.</i>

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:14.170
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:18.060
A brand new world is beginning
Ima hajimarunda

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:24.640
Even if there are painful things ahead
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:31.040
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:38.800
I'm starting to walk in a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:45.030
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:48.250
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.380
And there's no one who can stop it
Darenimo tomerarenai

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:56.400
My heart is tightening and out of control
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.760
So start flapping your wings from here
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.810
And soar high up into the sky
Ano sora he to takaku

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:09.780
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:13.110
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:16.380
That's what I believed
Sou shinjiteiru no

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:21.540
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:44.800
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:50.610
Currently, the symbol of faith, the topaz,

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:53.000
And the symbol of happiness, the ruby,

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:55.300
Are shining brightly in the Belt of Deltora.

00:02:56.060 --> 00:03:01.400
On their way towards the third gem, Lief and his friends, who were travelling towards the City of the Rats,

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:08.900
Were picked up by a mysterious group of people from a city on the way to their destination, Noradz.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:37.600
It's useless. I don't see any way to escape from here.

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:46.400
Are you alright, Jasmine?

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:48.700
Can't say that I am.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:51.600
I hate being confined in small spaces after all.

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:54.100
And my throat is so dry.

00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:00.650
I'm sure they're going to bring food and water soon enough.

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:03.400
I hope you're right.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:11.250
Excuse me, Master Reece.

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.800
What are we going to do about those three's meals?

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.100
Let's see...

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:19.540
I suppose I will deliver it to them myself during my break,

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:23.200
Along with their belongings, so that they won't be worried about a change of clothes.

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:25.500
Understood.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:27.580
Clean Noradzeer.

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:30.540
Clean Noradzeer!

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:42.700
I want... some water...

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:02.390
Isn't that... those people's...?

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:04.440
Why...?

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:09.330
I knew it, there isn't anyone coming for us. Just as I expected.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:14.320
Those guys... they're planning to starve us to death here!

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:15.550
I'm sure of it.

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:17.580
It's going to be fine. Someone will come soon-

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.440
Don't be naïve, Lief!

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:25.240
You are seriously kidding yourself if you think that
someone is going to come to your rescue every time!

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:28.600
Maybe by now they've already caught Filli too...

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:30.880
Jasmine...

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:34.580
Tira!

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:35.890
Shh! Be quiet!

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:48.620
I became worried...

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:54.490
The head of the Ra-Karcharz, Master Reece, said that he was going to bring your meal himself before, but...

00:05:54.490 --> 00:05:57.400
I was afraid he might forget to bring it to you...

00:05:57.400 --> 00:06:00.000
Yeah, nobody has come here.

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.550
That guy didn't just 'forget'.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:06.200
His intention was to starve us from the beginning!

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:07.650
That's impossible...!

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:10.390
Please, open the door.

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:12.100
Let us out of this cell.

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:15.680
I can't do that...

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:18.960
You three brought something evil into Noradz...

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:23.100
And made everyone... touch that evil thing!

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:27.270
Filli is not "evil"!

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:28.650
He is my friend!

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:30.530
Your friend...?

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:32.840
Please hear us out, Tira.

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:36.570
Where we come from, we don't consider animals like Filli to be "evil creatures".

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:39.200
Our way of thinking is very different to yours.

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:45.390
If we can't escape from here, we'll have no choice but to die in this prison cell.

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:49.330
Reece told you that he would deliver our food himself, right?

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.610
But he didn't come.

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:56.140
He lied to you all and has planned to kill the three of us from the very start.

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:57.970
It was the same with the cards.

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:01.870
It couldn't be...!

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:04.700
I'm begging you, Tira. Open this door for us!

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:08.560
Please...

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:12.390
We can't afford to die in this place...

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:28.840
I...

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:30.600
Thank you, Tira.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:34.900
We're going to leave this place right away. Can you tell us where the exit is?

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:37.090
It's no use!

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:39.420
All of the gates are being guarded at the moment...

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:43.540
Castles usually have one or two
secret passageways built into them.

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:44.540
Th-That's...

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:45.610
There is one!

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:47.800
Please lead the way, Tira.

00:07:56.890 --> 00:07:58.100
Sorry for this, Tira.

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:01.950
It's okay to just take us to the passage entrance.

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:03.420
It's just up ahead.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:05.300
It's at the top of these stairs.

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:06.980
But...

00:08:07.390 --> 00:08:08.590
What's wrong?

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:12.280
It's actually forbidden for us to be near that place.

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:14.050
Because it's 'very dangerous'.

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:18.500
Any place is dangerous for us as long as we remain in this city.

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:21.960
We'll be fine.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:43.150
The exit is just down the end of this hallway.

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:07.580
What in the world...?

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:09.160
What a feast...

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:13.310
Even though the three of us were almost starved to death earlier...

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:17.900
Are the chefs of this city working here all throughout the night?

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:18.750
Yes.

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:24.030
We prepare so much food because there's only a small amount that passes the quality inspection.

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:26.090
And the food that fails?

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:28.730
We throw it away outside of the city,

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:31.940
Through the passage that the three of you will leave through.

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:34.600
Why are you being so wasteful?

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:37.940
Because it's not good food!

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:42.400
The great Ra-Kacharz are protecting us all from disease and ailment.

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:43.800
Clean Noradzeer.

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:49.300
There is a limit to the insanity of being a hygiene freak.

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:54.190
Even though the people of Del are starving to the point where they fight for food scraps in the garbage...

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:58.230
It might be hard for you to believe, but it's the truth.

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:03.300
One of the objectives of our journey was to do something for the people of Del.

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.120
Is that right?

00:10:07.680 --> 00:10:09.800
We can continue on our own from here.

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:12.050
Thank you, Tira.

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:15.560
I've heard that this passage is an extremely dangerous place.

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:17.370
So please, be careful.

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:19.420
Goodbye.

00:10:57.990 --> 00:11:00.600
Is that the exit Tira was talking about?

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:02.330
It seems so.

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:04.240
It feels somewhat... creepy.

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:08.060
It's probably dangerous to approach it, especially without our weapons.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:10.940
But, we have to go on if we want to continue our journey.

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:11.840
Let's go.

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:13.900
I... won't go with you yet.

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:17.120
I know where the exit is now, so...

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:19.080
I'm going to search for Filli.

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:20.840
They're going to find us in no time!

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:22.300
He's right.

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:24.750
I never asked you two to come with me.

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:25.730
Jasmine!

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:28.920
You two travelled without me in the beginning, right?

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:32.590
So it won't matter now either. I'm looking for Filli, no matter what.

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:35.500
Wait, Lief!

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:38.070
You're going to get yourself caught as well!

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:38.760
But!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:39.900
You three.

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:51.600
You three,

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:53.760
How was it that you escaped from that prison cell?

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:54.700
Who knows?

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:57.000
Well, no matter.

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:01.360
But this way, your evil intentions have risen to the surface.

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:05.880
There's no doubt now that you were the ones who brought that evil creature into the dining hall.

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:07.250
What?!

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:12.230
The people of this city who were terrorised by that evil creature must be trembling in fear by now...

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:16.100
So much so that a thousand lashes may not compensate for your sins.

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:18.340
You dirty bastard!

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:21.300
You...!

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.750
You people who brought an evil creature to our city...

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.660
Disappear.

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:32.370
Clean Nor-

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:35.900
What do you mean "Clean Noradzeer"?!

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.000
You're the filthy one here!

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:41.530
Shut up, you filthy little girl.

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:43.980
Jasmine!

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:46.300
Stay away, you foul rogue!

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:52.720
I'm going to personally punish the three of you.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:01.220
Go on!

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:05.360
Once you enter that passageway, your lives will be forfeit!

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:14.310
Lief...

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.310
Barda...!

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:16.640
Clean Noradzeer!

00:13:17.090 --> 00:13:18.870
Clean Noradzeer!!

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:21.550
Clean Noradzeer!!!

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:35.900
Clean Noradzeer!!

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:37.900
Clean Noradzeer!!

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:43.500
Die now, you filthy little shits!

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:52.030
Tira!

00:13:58.370 --> 00:13:59.200
Tira.

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:00.900
Thank you very much.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.340
I...I...

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:07.420
I just wanted to be of some help to you guys...

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:10.000
At any rate, you have our thanks.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:13.800
We are grateful for your bravery from the bottom of our hearts.

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:21.900
More are coming!

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:26.300
Will you come with us?

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:30.940
They won't let you off easy if they find out what you've done, right?

00:14:40.590 --> 00:14:42.600
I will still stay here.

00:14:43.140 --> 00:14:44.590
Take care.

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:48.250
We will never forget you.

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:49.750
Me too.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.100
Good bye.

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:54.330
Be careful.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:55.470
Right!

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:00.980
You lot!

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:03.930
Master Reece?!

00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:07.110
How dare you, you filthy bastards!

00:15:17.070 --> 00:15:17.810
Filli!

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:38.430
Filli!!

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:42.590
I'm really glad you're alright...!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:44.270
Filli...!

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:50.470
It seems like Filli is more than just friend to Jasmine, doesn't it?.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:51.390
Yeah.

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:53.940
Alright, let's continue our journey.

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:57.050
Of course, you guys are coming with us too, right?

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:00.710
Well, I have no reason to decline now.

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:06.570
Either way, we still need to go down this eerie passage first.

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:10.400
But, that guy said that we won't survive if we go through here, didn't he?

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:13.360
Nevertheless, we have no choice but to go.

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:41.090
I wonder what this is...

00:16:41.090 --> 00:16:41.840
Stop!

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:45.000
Don't touch that! It might be dangerous.

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:47.650
Then how are we supposed to get through this passage?

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:52.080
I wonder if there's some way to protect ourselves from it.

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:56.260
Why is there a door here?

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:01.290
It looks like the Ra-Kacharz' clothes...

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:02.600
It gives me a bad feeling.

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:04.540
Let's use them!

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.000
They can work as a disguise!

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:07.900
That's true. Good idea.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:08.800
What?!

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:11.510
Here.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:15.090
Such bad taste...

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:27.390
What are those?

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:30.080
I've never seen mushrooms like these in my life.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:33.100
The footing here is really slippery. Be careful.

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:36.160
We should be close to the exit by now.

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:42.730
I see a light!

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:45.110
We can get out!

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:48.140
Don't be hasty, you'll slip!

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:03.700
What do you think?

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:04.700
It looks like the exit.

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:08.100
Barda!

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:16.850
You bastards who brought an evil creature to our city... I won't let you escape!

00:18:16.850 --> 00:18:17.780
Reece!

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:30.110
Disappear!

00:18:30.110 --> 00:18:32.290
You filthy rogues who defiled Noradz!

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.870
Clean Noradzeer!!

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:53.310
What's happening?

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:54.820
Toxic mushrooms?

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:02.640
Now that it's come to this... I'll take you with me...!

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:40.460
If it weren't for these clothes, then we would have ended up like him as well.

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:41.740
It seems so.

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:48.900
This is...!

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:52.130
It's the Shadow Lord's mark!

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:57.190
Does this mean that even Noradz is under the Shadow Lord's control?

00:19:57.190 --> 00:19:59.350
That would appear to be the case.

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:06.420
On the surface, it may look as if the Ra-Karcharz are in
control, but I believe the Shadow Lord rules this city himself.

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:08.610
No wonder it's such a bizarre place.

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:12.780
But, it's not just their food...

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:16.030
Why are they so obsessive about hygiene?

00:20:16.030 --> 00:20:17.930
Something seems off.

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.540
It's the 'bad food'.

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:40.120
Seems like they really do throw it away outside of the city, just as Tira said.

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:42.050
In other words, the exit is right there!

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:49.160
What's wrong?

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:50.590
Ra-Kacharz.

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:58.720
They seem to be loading the cart with food.

00:20:59.670 --> 00:21:01.180
Alright, that's all.

00:21:01.180 --> 00:21:05.600
It's a bit less than usual, since apparently something happened in the kitchens.

00:21:05.600 --> 00:21:07.370
Anyway, let's get a move on.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.360
We can't take any longer.

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:14.310
Rather than throwing it away, it's more like they're trying to transport it elsewhere.

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:17.290
Alright, let's sneak into that cart.

00:21:17.530 --> 00:21:19.000
Are you serious?

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:23.320
I've really had enough of those muddlet creatures...

00:21:24.060 --> 00:21:25.560
But I want to know.

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:29.170
Just where are they transporting that food...?

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:31.910
Fine.

00:21:41.380 --> 00:21:42.420
Kree...

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:44.570
I wonder if he can find me.

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:50.600
Kree!

00:21:51.230 --> 00:21:54.320
Still, just where in the world are they taking this food?

00:21:59.360 --> 00:22:00.370
Geez...

00:22:00.370 --> 00:22:02.450
How much further are we going to go?

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:04.220
What?

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:06.420
I think I recognise this place!

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:07.470
Katabra!

00:22:10.490 --> 00:22:11.290
This is...

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:17.900
It's Tom's Shop.

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:19.600
Hey, look at that!

00:22:23.240 --> 00:22:25.490
Grey Guards?!

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:27.280
But why?!

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:41.250
Cherry blossom flowers are fluttering down
Sakura maiochite yuku

00:22:41.520 --> 00:22:46.920
As if they were peeled from the sky
Sora kara hagareru you ni

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:52.880
I'm gripping and holding hard
Anata to ita omoide ha

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:58.650
The memories I have with you
Zutto gyutto dakishimeteru kara

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:05.950
All of a sudden, flower petals are in full bloom
Futto maue ni ukabu no ha

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:09.550
They're floating right above me
Mankai no hanabira

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:17.330
No matter how long I wait, no one is coming
Mattetatte mou daremo konai

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:24.300
Have I really left my wavering feelings behind?
Yureru omoi ha oitekitandeshou

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:32.540
I'm all alone right here, singing a song about cherry blossoms
Sakura uta utai nagara

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:38.480
Just waiting for no one else but you
Anata wo matsu watashi ha hitori

00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:44.490
This love has taught something to me:
Kono koi ga oshiete kureta

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:50.800
That true love is hidden on ordinary days
Heibon na hibi koso ai to

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:59.010
I present my last song to the spring breeze
Harukaze ni saigo no uta wo

00:24:06.820 --> 00:24:08.220
Kree and Filli.

00:24:09.150 --> 00:24:11.520
Jasmine's best friends.

00:24:11.920 --> 00:24:16.750
They are sensitive to danger and are able to alert the others to it.

00:24:16.750 --> 00:24:19.700
It seems like they and Jasmine are able to understand each other.

00:24:20.320 --> 00:24:23.510
The Broad River stretched out right before our path.

00:24:23.510 --> 00:24:28.180
To reach the City of the Rats where the gem is, we have to cross this river no matter what!

00:24:28.180 --> 00:24:30.830
Moreover, there are also terrible monsters in this place!

00:24:30.830 --> 00:24:32.110
Cross the Broad River

00:24:32.110 --> 00:24:34.610
<i>Next time, 'Cross the Broad River'!
Cross the Broad River</i>
